return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-30T01:02:32+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-30T01:02:32+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A complete help desk and AI assistant that runs on your own WordPress: an AI that answers from your own pages with links, live chat, and support tickets in wp-admin, on a submit-a-ticket page and in the WooCommerce account area. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until a visitor opens it.'=>'Cikakken tsarin taimako da mataimakin AI wanda ke aiki a kan WordPress naka: AI wanda ke ba da amsa daga shafukanka tare da hanyoyin haɗi, hira ta kai tsaye, da tikitin goyon baya a cikin wp-admin, a kan shafin gabatar da tikiti da kuma a cikin yankin asusun WooCommerce. Kasa da KB 10 a kan shafin kuma babu buƙatu sam sam har sai wani mai ziyara ya buɗe shi.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Inbox'=>'Akwatin saƙonni','Tickets'=>'Tiketi','Assistant'=>'Mataimaki','Settings'=>'Saituna','Setup'=>'Saita','Zinn® Chat could not create its database tables:'=>'Zinn® Chat ta kasa ƙirƙirar teburan bayanan ta:','The AI assistant could not answer a visitor:'=>'Mataimakin AI bai iya amsa wa baƙo ba:','Fix it'=>'Gyara shi','Loading…'=>'Ana lodawa...','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Wannan allo yana buƙatar JavaScript.','Chat'=>'Tattaunawa','AI assistant'=>'Mataimakin AI','Tickets and email'=>'Tiket da imel','Site index'=>'Jigon shafin','Privacy and spam'=>'Sirri da spam','Connect to Zinn Digital®'=>'Haɗa zuwa Zinn Digital®','Show the chat on the site'=>'Nuna taɗin a shafin','Nothing appears on the site, and nothing is loaded, until this is ticked.'=>'Ba abin da ke bayyana a shafin, kuma ba a loda komai, har sai an sanya alamar duba a nan.','Chat title'=>'Sunan tattaunawa','Greeting'=>'Gaisuwa','The first thing a visitor sees.'=>'Abu na farko da mai ziyara ke gani.','Greeting when nobody can answer'=>'Gaisuwa lokacin da babu wanda zai iya amsawa','Colour'=>'Launi','Text colour on the colour'=>'Launin rubutu a kan launin','Position'=>'Matsayi','Bottom, end side (right in left-to-right languages)'=>'Ƙasa, gefen ƙarshe (dama a cikin harsunan da ake rubutawa daga hagu zuwa dama)','Bottom, start side'=>'Kasa, gefen farawa','Offer "Talk to a person"'=>'Bada shawarar "Yi magana da mutum"','Shown while somebody has the Inbox open and is not set to away.'=>'Ana nuna wannan yayin da wani ke da Akwatin Saƙo a buɗe kuma ba a saita shi zuwa nesa ba.','Hide the chat from your support team while they are signed in'=>'Boyie da hira daga ƙungiyar goyon bayan ku yayin da suke shiga','Show "Powered by Zinn® Chat" under the chat'=>'Nuna "Powered by Zinn® Chat" a karkashin tattaunawar','Optional. Off unless you turn it on.'=>'Zabi ne. A kashe yake sai dai idan ka kunna shi.','Let the AI assistant answer visitors'=>'Bar mai taimakon AI ya amsa wa baƙi','Assistant name'=>'Sunan Mataimaki','Extra instructions for the assistant'=>'Ƙarin umarni ga mataimakin','For example: "Always mention our 30-day returns." They cannot override the safety rules.'=>'Misali: "Koyaushe ka ambaci manufarmu ta dawo da kayayyaki cikin kwanaki 30." Ba za su iya soke dokokin tsaro ba.','Answer language'=>'Yaren amsa','"auto" answers in the visitor\'s own language; or a locale such as en_GB or de_DE to always answer in one language.'=>'amsa "auto" a harshen mai ziyara; ko kuma yanki kamar en_GB ko de_DE don amsawa koyaushe cikin harshe ɗaya.','Minimum relevance'=>'Mafi ƙarancin dacewa','Passages scoring below this (0 to 0.95) are not used, and the assistant says it does not know. Check scores in the test console.'=>'Abubuwan da suka samu maki a ƙasa da wannan (0 zuwa 0.95) ba a amfani da su, kuma mataimakin yana cewa bai sani ba. Duba maki a cikin na\'urar gwaji.','Offer a person after this many unanswered questions'=>'Bayar da taygetProgress ga wani bayan wadannan tambayoyin da ba a amsa ba','Longest answer (tokens)'=>'Mafi tsawon amsa (tokens)','Accept support tickets'=>'Karɓi tikitin goyon baya','Support page'=>'Shafin goyon baya','The page with the [zinn_chat_support] shortcode or the Support page block. Ticket links in emails open this page.'=>'Shafin da ke dauke da gajeriyar lambar [zinn_chat_support] ko kuma tubalin Shafin Taimako. Hanyoyin haɗi na tikiti a cikin imel suna buɗe wannan shafin.','Send team alerts to'=>'Aiko wa da tawagar gargadi zuwa ga','One or more email addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site admin email.'=>'Adireshin imel ɗaya ko fiye, an raba su da waƙafi. Maras komai: imel ɗin mai kula da shafin.','Sender name on emails'=>'Sunan mai aikawa a cikin imel','Email the team when a visitor waits for a person longer than (minutes)'=>'Aiko wa ƙungiyar saƙon imel lokacin da mai ziyara ya jira mutum fiye da (mintuna)','Private ticket links work for (days after the last message)'=>'Hanyoyin haɗi na tikiti masu zaman kansu suna aiki don (kwanaki bayan saƙon ƙarshe)','After that the page offers to email a new link.'=>'Bayan haka, shafin yana ba da shawarar a aika da sabon hanyar haɗi ta imel.','Add a Support tab to the WooCommerce account area'=>'Ƙara shafin Tallafi a yankin lissafin WooCommerce','Let the assistant tell signed-in customers about their own orders'=>'Bar ma\'aikacin taimako ya gaya wa abokan ciniki da suka shiga game da nasu umarni','Answers "where is my order?" from the order status and tracking.'=>'Amsoshin "ina oda ta?" daga matsayin oda da bin diddigi.','Content the assistant reads'=>'Abubuwan da mataimakin ke karantawa','None ticked means every public type.'=>'Babu abin da aka zaba yana nufin kowane nau\'in jama\'a.','WooCommerce products, prices, stock, shipping and payment methods'=>'Kayayyakin WooCommerce, farashi, kaya a rumbun ajiya, jigila da hanyoyin biyan kudi','Forums (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)'=>'Dandali (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)','Read pages as visitors see them when a page builder\'s content cannot be read directly'=>'Karanta shafuka kamar yadda masu ziyara ke ganin su lokacin da ba a iya karanta abubuwan da ke cikin mai ginin shafi kai tsaye ba','Fetches the page from your own site in the background.'=>'Yana dauko shafin daga ainihin shafin ka a bango.','Never read these posts or pages (IDs)'=>'Karka taba karanta wadannan wallafe-wallafen ko shafukan (IDs)','Comma-separated.'=>'Wanda aka raba da wakafi.','Ask visitors to agree before a chat or ticket'=>'Ka roƙi baƙi su yarda kafin tattaunawa ko tikiti','Agreement text'=>'Rubutun yarjejeniya','Privacy policy link'=>'Hadin gwiwar sirri','Empty: the site\'s privacy policy page.'=>'Busa: shafin manufofin sirri na rukunin yanar gizon.','Delete finished chats and tickets after (days)'=>'Goge chat da tikiti da aka gama bayan (kwanaki)','0 keeps them.'=>'0 yana kiyaye su.','Store visitors\' IP addresses'=>'Adreshoshin IP na masu ziyartar shagon','Off: only a coded form is kept, enough for spam limits.'=>'Kashe: an adana tsarin da aka kintsake shi kawai, wanda ya isa ga iyakokin saƙonni marasa amfani.','Messages per visitor per hour'=>'Saƙonni ga kowane baƙo a cikin awa ɗaya','Chats per visitor per day'=>'Tattaunawa a kowace mai ziyara a rana','Tickets per visitor per day'=>'Tikiti ga kowace baƙo a rana kowace rana','Longest chat message (characters)'=>'Mafi tsayin saƙon taɗi (haruffa)','Block list'=>'Jerin masu hana shiga','One per line: an IP address, an email address, @domain.com, or a word.'=>'Daya a kowane layí: adireshin IP, adireshin imel, @domain.com, ko kalma.','Where chats are answered'=>'Inda ake amsa tattaunawa','"This site" keeps everything in this site\'s database and uses your own AI key. "Zinn Digital®" uses the hosted inbox in the Zinn® app (for Zinn® hosting customers).'=>'"Wannan shafin" yana adana komai a cikin bayanan shafin kuma yana amfani da maɓallin AI naka. "Zinn Digital®" yana amfani da akwatin saƙon da aka karɓi baƙi a cikin manhajar Zinn® (ga abokan cinikin daukar shafuka na Zinn®).','This site (recommended)'=>'Wannan shafin (ana ba da shawarar)','Zinn Digital® app'=>'Aikace-aikacen Zinn Digital®','Zinn® widget key'=>'Maɓallin widget na Zinn®','From the Zinn® app: Live chat, then your widget. Starts with zc_.'=>'Daga cikin manhajar Zinn®: Tattaunawa kai tsaye, sannan widget ɗinka. Yana farawa da zc_.','Zinn® Chat settings'=>'Saitunan Zinn® Chat','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','The assistant uses your own AI key.'=>'Mataimakin yana amfani da maɓallin AI naka.','AI providers and models'=>'Masu samar da AI da samfurori','— None —'=>'— Babu —','Saved — leave empty to keep'=>'A adana — a bar shi mara komai domin a rike','Remove the saved key'=>'Cire maɓallin da aka ajiye','You are not allowed to change these settings.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin canza waɗannan saitunan ba.','Turn the chat on'=>'Kunna tattaunawar','The chat is showing on your site.'=>'Tattaunawar tana nunawa a shafin ku.','Nothing is shown or loaded on your site until you turn it on.'=>'Ba abin da ake nunawa ko lodawa a shafinka har sai ka kunna shi.','Turn off'=>'Kashe','Turn on'=>'Kunna','Connect your AI provider'=>'Haɗa mai ba da sabis ɗin AI naka','Connected. Site search uses %1$s (%2$s).'=>'An haɗa. Binciken shafin yana amfani da %1$s (%2$s).','Connected. Your provider cannot build a meaning-based index, so the assistant uses keyword search. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key for better answers.'=>'An haɗa. Mai ba da sabis ɗin ku ba zai iya gina fihirisa ta tushen ma\'ana ba, don haka mataimakin yana amfani da binciken maɓalli. Ƙara maɓallin Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter don samun ingantattun amsoshi.','Add a key for Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter or any OpenAI-compatible service. The newest model is chosen for you; you can change it.'=>'Ƙara maɓalli na Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter ko kowane sabis ɗin da ya dace da OpenAI. An zaɓa muku sabon samfurin; za ku iya canza shi.','AI providers'=>'Masu samar da AI','Let the assistant read your site'=>'Bar mataimaki ya karanta shafin ku','%1$d pages read, %2$d waiting, %3$d passages. New and edited content is picked up automatically.'=>'Shafuka %1$d da aka karanta, %2$d suna jiran gani, sassan %3$d. Ana ɗaukar sabbin abubuwa da waɗanda aka gyara ta atomatik.','Read the whole site now'=>'Karanta daukacin shafin yanzu','Create your support page'=>'Ƙirƙiri shafin tallafin ku','Visitors submit tickets there, and ticket emails link to it.'=>'Masu ziyara suna aika da tikiti a can, kuma imel na tikiti suna da hanyar haɗi zuwa gare shi.','A page with the ticket form, where customers also follow their requests.'=>'Wani shafi mai dauke da fom na tikiti, inda abokan ciniki kuma suke bin diddigin bukatunsu.','View'=>'Kalli','Create the support page'=>'Ƙirƙiri shafin goyon baya','Add "Submit a ticket" and "Chat with us" to a menu'=>'Ƙara "Ƙaddamar da tikiti" da "Yi hira da mu" zuwa menu','Appearance, Menus: use the Zinn® Chat box. Or add the Zinn® Chat blocks to any page, in any page builder.'=>'Bayyanar, Menus: yi amfani da akwatin Zinn® Chat. Ko kuma ƙara tubalan Zinn® Chat zuwa kowane shafi, a cikin kowane mai gina shafi.','Menus'=>'Kundin bayani','WooCommerce account area'=>'Wurin Asusun WooCommerce','Customers see their tickets under Support in My Account, and the assistant can tell them where their order is.'=>'Abokan ciniki suna ganin tikitinsu a ƙarƙashin Sashen Taimako a cikin Asusuna, kuma mataimakin zai iya gaya musu inda odar su yake.','Test the assistant'=>'Gwada mataimaki','Ask it questions and see exactly which pages it answered from, including out-of-date ones.'=>'Yi masa tambayoyi kuma ka ga ainihin shafukan da ya amsa daga ciki, har da waɗanda suka wuce lokaci.','Open the test console'=>'Buɗe na\'urar gwaji','Answer live chats'=>'Amsa hira ta kai tsaye','Visitors can ask for a person while you have the Inbox open. It works on a phone too.'=>'Masu ziyara za su iya neman wani mutum yayin da ka buɗe Akwatin Saƙo (Inbox). Yana aiki a kan waya ma.','Open the Inbox'=>'Buɗe Akwatin Saƙonni','Set up Zinn® Chat'=>'Saita Zinn® Chat','This site is connected to the Zinn Digital® app: chats are answered there. To run the help desk on this site instead, choose "This site" under Settings, Connect to Zinn Digital®.'=>'An haɗa wannan shafin da manhajar Zinn Digital®: a can ake amsa tattaunawar. Don sarrafa cibiyar taimako a kan wannan shafin maimakon haka, zaɓi "Wannan shafin" a ƙarƙashin Saituna, Haɗa zuwa Zinn Digital®.','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ba ka da izinin yin hakan.','Unlimited agents, with a Support agent role that sees only chats and tickets'=>'Wakilai marasa iyaka, tare da matsayin wakilin Tallafi wanda ke ganin hira da tikiti kawai','Reply to tickets by email'=>'Amsa wa tikitin ta imel','Knowledge base: articles, categories, search, and a KB section in the chat'=>'Tushen ilimi: labarai, nau\'ikan, bincike, da kuma sashen KB a cikin tattaunawar','Saved replies, business hours, priorities and SLAs'=>'Amsoshin da aka adana, lokutan aiki, fifiko da SLA','Suggested replies, thread summaries and auto-tagging by AI'=>'Amsoshin da aka ba da shawara, taƙaitattun zaren tattaunawa da sakawa ta atomatik ta hanyar AI','Knowledge-gap report: the questions your site could not answer'=>'Rahoton gibin ilimi: tambayoyin da shafin yanar gizon ku bai iya amsa ba','Push notifications and an installable agent app for your phone'=>'Sanarwa ta turawa da kuma manhajar wakili da za a iya shigarwa a wayarka','Proactive messages, reports, webhooks, Slack and Telegram alerts'=>'Saƙonnin faɗakarwa, rahotanni, gidan yanar gizo, da faɗakarwa na Slack da Telegram','Zinn® Chat Pro'=>'Zinn® Chat Pro','From $%1$d a month or $%2$d a year for one site.'=>'Daga $%1$d a wata ko $%2$d a shekara don shafi guda daya.','Try Pro free for 14 days'=>'Gwada Pro kyauta na kwanaki 14','See plans'=>'Duba tsare-tsare','No card needed for the trial.'=>'Ba a buƙatar katin biyan kuɗi don gwaji.','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Masu ƙirƙirar ChatGPT. Mai amfani a kowane fanni.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Masu ƙirƙirar Claude. Suna da ƙarfi wajen rubutawa da kuma yin tunani mai zurfi.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Samfuran Gemini na Google. Sauri da rahusa.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Wani kamfanin AI na Turai mai saurin gaske kuma mai arha.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Samfuran masu araha waɗanda ke da ƙwarewa wajen rubutu da shirya lambobi.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Maɓalli guda ɗaya don samfuran daga masu samarwa daban-daban.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Duk wani sabis da ke aiki kamar OpenAI API, gami da samfurin da ke aiki a kan kwamfutarka ko uwar garken ka.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Janar (ana amfani da shi lokacin da ba a saita wani abu mai takamaimai ba)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Rubutu da sake rubutu','Translation'=>'Fassara','Code and CSS'=>'Lambar da kuma CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin shiga wannan shafin ba.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Wadannan saitunan suna da alaƙa da kowane plugin da ke amfani da su: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'An ɓoye Maɓallan ku a cikin bayanan wannan shafin kuma ana aika su ne kawai zuwa ga mai ba da sabis ɗin da kuka zaɓa — ba a taɓa aika su zuwa gare mu ba.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Mataki na 1 na 2: zabi mai ba da sabis na AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Kana kawo maɓallin kanka, don haka kana biyan mai bayar da sabis ɗin kai tsaye don abin da kake amfani da shi. Ba ka da tabbas? Ko wanne daga cikin waɗannan yana aiki sosai; za ka iya ƙara wasu daga baya.','Next'=>'Na gaba','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Mataki na 2 daga cikin 2: haɗa %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗin da ke dace da OpenAI, wanda ya ƙare da /v1. Ana buƙatar maɓalli ne kawai idan sabis ɗin ya nema.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Buɗe %s sannan ka shiga (ko ka ƙirƙiri sabon ajiya kyauta).','the %s API keys page'=>'shafin maɓallan API na %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli kuma ka kwafa shi.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'A manna a kasa sannan ka danna "Ajiye kuma ka gwada". Muna tura karamar roko daya don bincika ko tana aiki.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Yawancin masu ba da sabis na buƙatar ɗan kuɗi a cikin asusun kafin maɓalli ya yi aiki: %s.','add credit'=>'kara kudi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Zabi wani mai ba da sabis daban','Address'=>'Adireshishi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Maɓallin da aka adana ya ƙare da …%s — liƙa sabo don maye gurbinsa','Key (optional)'=>'Maɓalli (zaɓi)','API key'=>'Maɓallin API','Save and test'=>'Ajiye kuma a gwada','Providers'=>'Masu samarwa','Provider'=>'Mai ba da sabis','Status'=>'Matsayi','Key'=>'Mabuɗi','Get a key'=>'Samu maɓalli','Test'=>'Gwaji','Remove'=>'Cire','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Wani sabon sigar plugin ya adana shi: sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma a sake shigar da maɓallin.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin da aka ajiye ba kuma (an canza maɓallin tsaro na shafin). Shigar da shi a karo na biyu.','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'An haɗa — gwajin ƙarshe ya yi nasara %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Gwajin da ya gabata ya gaza: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'An haɗa — ba a gwada ba tukuna','Which model to use'=>'Wanne samfurin za a yi amfani da shi','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ tana nuna shawararmu ga wannan aiki. Lissafin ya haɗa da kowane samfurin da maɓallinku zai iya amfani da shi, wanda aka karanta kai tsaye daga mai bada sabis ɗin.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— An ba da shawarar ga mai bada sabis —','Save models'=>'Ajiye samfura','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sabunta jerin samfuran daga masu samarwa','Images'=>'Hotuna','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Haɗa OpenAI ko Google Gemini don yin hotuna.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin hoto na farko na mai ba da sabis ɗin da aka haɗa —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Binciken shafin (embeddings)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter don gina fihirisar bincike na shafin ku.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin sakawa na farko mai alaƙa da mai ba da sabis —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Canza wannan yana sake gina fihirisar bincike ta kowane jigon da ke amfani da ita.','best quality'=>'mafi kyau','lowest cost'=>'mafi ƙarancin farashi','fastest'=>'mafi sauri','Add a model yourself'=>'Ƙara samfuri da kanka','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'An fitar da wani samfuri a yau? Manna daidai sunansa domin amfani da shi nan take.','Model name'=>'Sunan samfurin','Add model'=>'Ƙara samfurin','Recommended models list'=>'Jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Ba a iya tabbatar da jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar ba, don haka ba a nuna shawarwari ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin, ko kuma kunna sabuntawa na yau da kullum a ƙasa.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Jerin da ake amfani da shi an buga shi a ranar %s. Kowane sabuntawar fasalin ƙari yana kawo sabon ɗaya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Har ila yau, bincika Zinn Digital® sau ɗaya a rana don samun sabon jerin abubuwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ana aika da sauƙaƙe buƙatar saukarwa kawai: babu makulli, babu adireshin shafin, babu komai game da abun ciki naka. An sanya hannu a kan jerin, kuma an yi watsi da jerin da ya kasa binciken sa hannun.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'An bincika karshe a ranar %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Ajiye, kuma bincika yanzu idan an kunna','a newer list was installed'=>'an shigar da sabon jerin sunaye','already up to date'=>'rigakken sabunta','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'saukarwar ta gaza a wajen binciken sa hannu kuma an yi watsi da ita','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Ba za a iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba; jerin na yanzu zai ci gaba da amfani','turned off'=>'an kashe','Open'=>'Buɗe','Check their status page'=>'Bincika shafin yanar gizon su na matsayi','Open your billing page'=>'Buɗe shafin biyan kuɗi naka','Open your API keys page'=>'Buɗe shafin maɓallan API ɗinka','Open the AI settings'=>'Buɗe saitunan AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ba.','Unknown provider.'=>'Ba a san mai ba da sabis din ba.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗin ku, alal misali http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Wannan bai yi kama da maɓallin API ba. Sake kwafi shi, ba tare da sarari ba.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Da farko ka manna mabudin API ɗinka.','Key removed.'=>'An cire maɓallin.','Models saved.'=>'An adana samfuran.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Shigar dainiyan sunan samfurin, misali kamar yadda takardun bayanin mai ba da sabis suka rubuta shi.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'An kara %s. Zabi shi a ƙarƙashin "Wanne nau\'i ne za a yi amfani da shi".','Model removed.'=>'An cire samfurin.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'An kashe sabuntawa kullum. Ana amfani da jerin da ya zo tare da plugin din.','Checked: %s.'=>'An bincika: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'An sabunta jerin samfuran.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'An adana maɓallin AI ɗinka ta hanyar wani sabon salo na ɗaya daga cikin na\'urorinka na ƙari (plugins). Sabunta wannan na\'urar ta ƙari, ko kuma ka sake shigar da maɓallin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin AI ɗinka da aka adana ba (an canza maɓallin tsaro na shafin). Sake shigar da shi a cikin saitunan AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a saita AI ba tukuna. Ƙara maɓalli don mai ba da AI a cikin saitunan AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a zaɓi wani samfur ba don wannan aikin. Zaɓi ɗaya a cikin saitunan AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba a goyi bayansa da wannan sigar ta filagin ba.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Babu mai samar da AI da zai iya ƙirƙirar hotuna da aka haɗa. Ƙara maɓallin OpenAI ko Google Gemini a cikin saitunan AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan mai samar da AI ba zai iya yin hotuna ba. Zabi OpenAI ko Google Gemini don hotuna a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Maɓallin AI ɗinka ba zai iya amfani da kowane samfurin hoto ba. Duba izinin maɓallin tare da mai bayarwa, ko zaɓi wani mai bayarwa don hotuna.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Babu wani mai samar da AI da aka haɗa da zai iya gina fihirisar bincike. Ƙara maɓallin Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Maɓallin AI ɗinka ba zai iya amfani da kowane samfurin jeri ba. Duba izinin maɓallin tare da mai samarwa, ko zaɓi wani mai samarwa don binciken shafin.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya gina fihirisar bincike ba. Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko sabis ɗin da ya dace don binciken shafin.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya isa ga sabis na AI naka ba. Tabbatar cewa yana aiki kuma ana iya isa ga adireshinsa daga sabar yanar gizon ku (ba za a iya isa ga sabis da ke kan kwamfutarka ba daga wani shafin da aka karbi bakoninsa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya isa ga %s ba. Duba shafin matsayinsu; idan suna aiki, mai masaukin bakinka na iya toshe haɗin gwiwa na fita, ko kuma adireshin ba daidai bane.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s ya ce asusunka ba shi da ragowar bashi ko adadi. Ƙara kuɗi ko ƙara iyakarka a cikin asusunka tare da su, sannan a sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s bai karɓi maɓallin ku ba. Wataƙila an rubuta shi ba daidai ba, an soke shi, ko kuma ya ƙare. Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli kuma liƙa shi anan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s ya ki amincewa da wannan roko don mabuɗinku. Wataƙila mabuɗin ba shi da damar shiga wannan samfurin ko siffa, ko kuma asusunku yana buƙatar tabbatarwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Babu samfurin "%1$s" daga %2$s don maɓallin ku. Zabi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Tsarin ku na %2$s baya kunshi samfurin "%1$s". Zaɓi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI, ko haɓaka tsarin ku tare da su.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s yana iyakance saurin da makullin ku ke iya aika buƙatu. Jira minti ɗaya sannan ku sake gwadawa, ko kuma ku ƙara iyakar ƙimar ku tare da su.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s na fuskantar matsaloli a yanzu (akwai matsalar katsewar sabis ko cunkoso a wurinsu). Babu wata matsala da ta faru da saitunanku. Sake gwadawa nan ba da dadewa ba.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Omrarin AI ya gaza saboda dalilin da ba za mu iya gane shi ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, tuntuɓi goyon baya tare da bayanan da ke ƙasa.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI ya ba da amsa a wata sifa da wannan plugin din ba zai iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ta ci gaba da faruwa, zaɓi wani samfurin ko tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Na musamman (Mai jituwa da OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Ajiye madogara don wannan mai bada sabis ɗin tukuna.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Makullin ku na aiki, amma mai ba da sabis ɗin bai lissafa wani samfurin rubutu a kansa ba. Ƙara wani samfurin da kanku a ƙasa.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s ya/ta amsa ta amfani da %2$s. Siffofin ku na AI suna shirye don amfani.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ba a ba matsayin mai amfani naka izinin amfani da AI a wannan shafin ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar kasafin kudinsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar buƙatunsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Amfani da tsada','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Shafin rajista, iyaka da izinin mukamai suna aiki ga AI da ake amfani da su ta hanyar: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kididdigar farashin ta yi kusa da gaskiya, an lissafta su ne daga farashin da aka wallafa; samfurin da babu sanannen farashi a kansa yana zama sifili.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Wannan watan: buƙatun %1$s, kusan %2$s.','When'=>'Lokacin da','Who'=>'Wane','Used for'=>'Yi amfani da shi don','Model'=>'Samfuri','Tokens in / out'=>'Alamomin shiga / fita','About'=>'Game game','Result'=>'Sakamako','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ba a yi buƙatun AI ko ɗaya ba tuƙuna.','Done'=>'An gama','Limits and permissions'=>'Iyakoki da izini','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iyakokin kashe kuɗi na wata-wata (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Bar shi a bude don babu iyaka. AI zai tsaya na sauran watan idan kusan farashin ya kai shi.','Monthly request limit'=>'Iyakokin buƙatu na wata-wata','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bar shi babu komai don babu iyaka.','Who may use AI'=>'Wane ne zai iya amfani da AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Ka cire komai domin barin duk wanda zai iya amfani da fasalolin plugin din ya yi amfani da AI. Masu gudanarwa za su iya amfani da shi a kowane lokaci.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ajiye iyakoki da izini','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'An adana iyakoki da izini.','Content'=>'Abubuwan da ke ciki','Not found.'=>'Ba a samo ba.','%s joined the chat.'=>'%s ya shiga tattaunawar.','Type a reply first.'=>'Rubuta amsa da farko.','The chat has ended. Thank you for contacting us.'=>'Tattaunawar ta ƙare. Na gode da tuntuɓar mu.','You are chatting with the assistant again.'=>'Kuna sake tattaunawa da mataimaki.','This conversation is now ticket #%d. We will reply by email.'=>'An ce wannan tattaunawar ta zama tikiti #%d yanzu. Za mu ba da amsa ta imel.','Type a question first.'=>'Rubuta tambaya da farko.','The whole site is being read again in the background.'=>'Ana sake karanta dukan shafin a bango.','Meanings are being rebuilt in the background.'=>'Ana sake gina ma\'anonin a baya.','Submit a ticket form'=>'Miƙa fom ɗin tikiti','Heading'=>'Taken kai','Default subject'=>'Jigon tsoho','Button text'=>'Rubutun maɓalli','Show the subject field (yes or no)'=>'Nuna fagen jigo (eh ko a\'a)','My support requests'=>'Buƙatun tallafina','Chat button'=>'Mabuɗin taɗi','Chat with us'=>'Yi hira da mu','Support'=>'Goyon baya','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d. We have emailed you a link to follow it.'=>'Na gode. Bukatar ku ita ce tikiti #%d. Mun tura muku da imel hanyar da za ku bi ta.','Your reply has been sent.'=>'An tura amsar ku.','If there is a request under that address, we have emailed you a new link.'=>'Idan akwai buƙata a ƙarƙashin wannan adireshin, mun turo muku da sabon mahaɗi ta imel.','Something went wrong. Please check the form and try again.'=>'Wani abu ya tafi ba daidai ba. Da fatan za a duba fom ɗin sannan a sake gwadawa.','Your message could not be sent.'=>'Ba a iya aika sakon ka ba.','You are sending messages too quickly. Please wait a little and try again.'=>'Kuna aika sakonni da sauri sosai. Da fatan za a dan jira sannan a sake gwadawa.','Please agree to the privacy notice to send your request.'=>'Da fatan za a yarda da sanarwar sirri don aika da buƙatarku.','Please complete the check to show you are not a robot.'=>'Don Allah cika gwajin don nuna cewa kai ba robot ba ne.','Sign in to see your support requests.'=>'Shiga ciki don ganin buƙatun tallafin ku.','Your name'=>'Sunanka','Your email'=>'Imel ɗinka','Subject'=>'Batun','Which order is this about?'=>'Wane oda ne wannan game da shi?','Not about an order'=>'Ba game da oda ba','How can we help?'=>'Ta ya za mu iya taimako?','Privacy policy'=>'Manufar sirri','Send request'=>'Aika da buƙata','All requests'=>'Dukkan buƙatun','Your support requests'=>'Buƙatun goyon bayan ku','You have no support requests yet.'=>'Ba ka da buƙatun tallafi tukuna.','Updated'=>'An sabunta','New request'=>'Sabon buƙata','This link has expired. Enter your email address and we will send you a new one.'=>'Wannan hanyar ta ƙare. Shigar da adireshin imel ɗinka kuma za mu aiko maka da sabuwa.','This link is not valid. Enter your email address and we will send you a link to your requests.'=>'Wannan mahaɗar ba ta da inganci. Shigar da adireshin imel ɗinka kuma za mu tura maka mahaɗa zuwa ga buƙatunka.','Email me a new link'=>'Aiko mani sabon mahada','Request #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Buƙata ta #%1$d: %2$s','Status:'=>'Matsayi:','Your reply'=>'Martaninku','Send reply'=>'Aika martani','You'=>'Kai','Submit a ticket'=>'Sigar da tikiti','Add to Menu'=>'Ƙara zuwa Menu','Create the support page on the Zinn® Chat setup screen to add a "Submit a ticket" link.'=>'Ƙirƙiri shafin tallafi a kan allon saiti na Zinn® Chat don ƙara hanyar haɗi ta "Submit a ticket".','[#%1$d] We have your request: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Mun karɓi buƙatar ku: %2$s','Thank you for contacting us. We have received your request and will reply as soon as we can.'=>'Na gode da tuntube mu. Mun karɓi buƙatar ku kuma za mu ba da am្សា da zaran mun iya.','View your request'=>'Duba roƙonku','[#%1$d] New ticket: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Sabon tikiti: %2$s','Open the ticket'=>'Buɗe tikiti','[#%1$d] New reply: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Sabon martani: %2$s','You can reply on the page below.'=>'Kuna iya ba da amsa a shafin da ke ƙasa.','View and reply'=>'Duba kuma ka ba da amsa','[#%1$d] Customer replied: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Abokin ciniki ya amsa: %2$s','A visitor is waiting in chat #%d'=>'Wani baƙo yana jiran a tattaunawa ta #%d','A visitor asked to talk to a person and is waiting for an answer.'=>'Wani baƙo ya nemi magana da mutum kuma yana jiran amsa.','Answer now'=>'Amsa yanzu','Your chat with %s'=>'Hirarkiyar ku tare da %s','[#%d] Your link to your request'=>'[#%d] Hadin da kake nema don buƙatarka','Here is a new link to your request. The old one no longer works.'=>'Ga sabon hanyar haɗi zuwa buƙatarku. Tsohuwar ba ta kuma aiki.','From: %s'=>'Daga: %s','a visitor'=>'wani mai ziyara','Zinn® Chat chats and support tickets'=>'Hirarrun Zinn® Chat da tikitin tallafi','Chats'=>'Tattaunawa','Started'=>'An fara','Name'=>'Sunan','Email'=>'Imel','Page'=>'Shafi','Messages'=>'Saƙonni','Support tickets'=>'Tikitin goyon baya','Ticket'=>'Tikiti','Opened'=>'An bude','When you use the chat or submit a support request, we store your messages, the name and email address you give us, the page you were on and a coded form of your IP address, so that we can answer you and keep a record of your request.'=>'Lokacin da ka yi amfani da hira ko ka gabatar da roƙon goyon baya, muna ajiye saƙonni naka, suna da adreshin imel da ka ba mu, shafin da kake kai da kuma wani tsari mai lamba na adreshin IP naka, domin mu iya amsa maka da kuma ajiye bayanin roƙonka.','If our AI assistant answers you, your message and passages from this website are sent to the AI provider we use to produce the answer.'=>'Idan mataimakinmu na AI ya amsa maka, saƙonka da sassan da suka fito daga wannan shafin yanar gizon ana aika su ne zuwa ga mai ba da sabis na AI da muke amfani da shi don samar da amsar.','The chat is not available right now.'=>'Hira ba ta da yanzu.','Please type a message.'=>'Don Allah rubuta sako.','Please agree to the privacy notice to start the chat.'=>'Don Allah ka yarda da sanarwar sirri don fara tattaunawar.','You have started too many chats today. Please try again tomorrow or send us a ticket.'=>'Ka fara tattaunawa da yawa a yau. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa gobe ko a aiko mana da tikiti.','The chat could not be started. Please try again.'=>'Ba a iya fara tattaunawar ba. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa.','Nobody can answer in chat right now. Leave your email address and we will reply by email.'=>'Ba wanda zai iya amsa kira a hira yanzu. Bar adreshin imel ɗin ku kuma za mu ba da amsa ta imel.','The assistant cannot answer right now. You can ask for a person or leave us a message.'=>'Mataimakin ba zai iya amsa tambaya yanzu ba. Za ka iya neman mutum ko ka bar mana sako.','We are putting you through to a person. Please stay on this page.'=>'Muna tura ku ga wani mutum. Da fatan za a tsaya a wannan shafin.','This chat has ended.'=>'An rufe wannan tattaunawar.','Tickets are not available right now.'=>'Ba a samun tikiti a yanzu.','Visitor'=>'Mai ziyara','Team'=>'Ƙungiya','Chat so far:'=>'Tattaunawa kawo yanzu:','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d and we will reply by email.'=>'Na gode. Rokonku shine tikiti #%d kuma za mu ba ku amsa ta imel.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Da fatan za a shigar da ingantacciyar adireshin imel.','This link is not valid.'=>'Wannan hanyar haɗin ba ta da inganci.','This link has expired. We can email you a new one.'=>'Wannan hanyar ta ƙare. Za mu iya aika muku da sabuwa ta imel.','You cannot see this ticket.'=>'Ba za ka iya ganin wannan tikitin ba.','Hi! Ask me anything about this site. I answer from its own pages, and I can put you through to a person.'=>'Sannu! Ka tambaye ni duk abin da kake so game da wannan shafin. Ina bayar da amsa daga shafukansa kansa, kuma zan iya haɗa ka da wani mutum.','Hi! How can we help? Send us a message and we will get back to you.'=>'Sannu! Ta yaya za mu iya taimakawa? Aiko mana da sako kuma za mu dawo gare ku.','Nobody is online right now. Leave your question and email address and we will reply by email.'=>'Babu wanda yake online a yanzu. Bar tambayarka da adireshin imel dinka kuma za mu ba da amsa ta imel.','We keep this conversation so we can answer you.'=>'Muna adana wannan tattaunawa ta yadda za mu iya ba ku amsa.','Please enter a valid email address so we can reply.'=>'Don Allah shigar da ingantacciyar adreshin imel domi