ur account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'An kunna asusun ku cikin nasara tare da tsarin %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Mai aiki','Add another domain'=>'Ƙara wani domain ɗin','Add-Ons'=>'Ƙarin Kaya','Add Ons for %s'=>'Ƙarin kayan aiki na %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya loda jerin kari ba. Wataƙila matsala ce daga ɓangarenmu, da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan ‘yan mintoci kaɗan.','Add-On'=>'Ƙari','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ƙarin abinci ne na musamman na biya kawai. Dole ne ka sayi lasisi tukuna kafin ka kunna wannan plugin ɗin.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'An nasarar siyan %s Add-on.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'An inganta tsarin %s Add-on ɗinka cikin nasara.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'An cire rajistar gwaji ta %s kyauta cikin nasara. Tunda ƙarin yana da alaƙa da fure ne kawai, an kashe shi ta atomatik. Idan kana son amfani da shi nan gaba, dole ne ka sayi lasisi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'Ba za a iya gudanar da %s ba ba tare da plugin din ba.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ba zai iya aiki ba ba tare da %2$s ba.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Ina san sanar da kai cewa ana jawo bayanan ƙarin kayan aiki na %s daga wani sabar na waje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Kariyar module %s','Address Line %d'=>'Layin Adireshi %d','Affiliate'=>'Wakili','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Saboda keta sharuddan haɗin gwiwarmu, mun yanke shawa