a ka da lasisi mai inganci don samun damar shiga nau\'in farko.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Shigarwa ta atomatik tana aiki ne kawai ga masu amfani da suka yi rajista.','Premium version already active.'=>'Sigar Premium tana aiki tuni.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar ƙarin fasali ta musamman.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plugin "Serviceware" ne wato bashi da sigar lambar yabo ta musamman.','Automatic Installation'=>'Shigarwa ta Kanta','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kashewa ta atomatik a cikin:','Average Rating'=>'Matsakaicin Matsayi','Awesome'=>'Madalla','based on %s'=>'danganta da %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Zama abokin hulɗa','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Kamar %s? Zama jakadanmu kuma ka sami tsabar kuɗi ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Sannu, ka san cewa %1$s yana da shirin haɗin gwiwa? Idan kuna son %2$s za ku iya zama jakadan mu kuma ku sami ɗan kuɗi!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Mafi kyau','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Sabuntawa zuwa sigar Beta zata maye gurbin sigar da ka shigar na %s da sabon sigar Beta - yi amfani da shi cikin hankali, kuma kada a yi amfani da shi a shafukan aiki. An riga an gargade ka.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'An biya %s','Billing'=>'Biyan Kuɗi','Billing & Invoices'=>'Biɗa da Lissafi','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'An toshe','Blocking'=>'Ana kullewa','Blog ID'=>'ID na Shafin Yanar Gizo','Body'=>'Jiki','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Eh - adireshin biyu nawa ne','Bundle'=>'Kunshe','Bundle Plan'=>'Tsarin Kunshin','Business name'=>'Sunan kasuwanci','Buy license'=>'Sayen lasisi','Buy a license now'=>'Sayi lasisi yanzu','Cancel Installation'=>'Soke Shigarwa','Cancel Subscription'=>'Soke Biya','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Idan ba ka/ki da shirin amfani da wannan %1$s a kan wannan shafin (ko wani shafi ma) - za ka/ki so ka/ki soke %2$s ma?','Cancel Trial'=>'Soke Gwaji','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Soke gwaji zai hana shiga dukkan abubuwan da suka fi fice nan da nan. Kuna da tabbas?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Soke %s & Ci gaba','Cancelled'=>'An soke','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Ana soke biyan kuɗi','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ba za ka iya samun maɓallin lasisin ka ba?','Change License'=>'Canza Lasisi','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'An tura imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Dole ne ka tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa. Idan ba za ka iya samun imel din ba, da fatan za a duba babban fayil din spam naka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'An tura imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Dole ne mai imel ya tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s shine sabon mai mallakar asusun.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Na gode da tabbatar da sauyin mallaka. An aika da imel zuwa %s domin amincewa ta ƙarshe.','Change Ownership'=>'Canja Mallaka','Change Plan'=>'Canja Tsari','Change User'=>'Canja Mai Amfani','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Ta hanyar sauya mai amfani, kun yarda ku canja wurin mallakar asusun zuwa ga:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Littafin Canje-canje','Changing user, please wait'=>'Ana canza mai amfani, don Allah a jira','