e buƙata ya yi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Yi rijista don karɓar sanarwar imel don sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da raba wasu mahimman bayanan muhalli na WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, babu damuwa! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki sosai.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Mun gabatar da wannan zaɓi don kar ka taɓa rasa wani muhimmin sabuntawa kuma ka taimake mu mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da shafin yanar gizon ku da kuma fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙatar ya yi.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Muna farin cikin gabatar da haɗin gwiwar Freemius a matakin cibiyar sadarwa.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Lokacin sabuntawa mun gano shafin ko shafuka %s a cikin hanyar sadarwa wadanda har yanzu ke jiran kulawar ku.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'A lokacin sabuntawa mun gano rukunin yanar gizo %d da ke jiran kunna lasisi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Idan kana so ka yi amفani da %s a waɗannan shafuka, don Allah ka shigar da maɓallin lasisinka a ƙasa sannan ka danna maɓallin kunnawa.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'A madadin haka, za ka iya tsallake shi a yanzu ka kunna lasisin daga baya, a shafinAccount na sadarwa na %s dinka.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Haɗe da shi','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Da zarar 